msgstr "Ponovni uvoz datoteke"

#: partials/csv-import-page.php:47
msgid "A row with a start time is skipped as a duplicate when a saved meeting has the same title and date and either the same start time or no start time. A row without a start time is skipped when any saved meeting has the same title and date. Uploading the same file twice does not create copies."
msgstr "Vrstica s časom začetka se preskoči kot dvojnik, ko ima shranjena seja enak naslov in datum ter bodisi enak čas začetka ali pa nima navedenega časa začetka. Vrstica brez časa začetka se preskoči, ko ima katera koli shranjena seja enak naslov in datum. Dvakratno nalaganje iste datoteke ne ustvari dvojnikov."

#: partials/csv-import-page.php:48
msgid "The match uses what is saved on each meeting now, not what the file originally said. If you change a meeting's title or date after importing it, or change its start time to a different time when the row has one, the original row no longer matches and importing that file again creates a new meeting. To change existing meetings, edit them in WordPress instead of importing again."
msgstr "Ujemanje uporablja tisto, kar je trenutno shranjeno pri vsaki seji, in ne tistega, kar je prvotno pisalo v datoteki. Če po uvozu spremenite naslov ali datum seje ali spremenite njen čas začetka v drug čas, ko ima vrstica določenega, se izvirna vrstica ne ujema več in ponovni uvoz te datoteke ustvari novo sejo. Če želite spremeniti obstoječe seje, jih uredite v WordPressu, namesto da bi jih znova uvažali."

